<title>FINLAND: TURKISTUOTTAJAT 6-MTH PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>TURKISTUOTTAJAT 6-MTH PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28 vs</p>
<p>six months to January 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    21.4 vs 34.5</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.99 vs 6.57</p>
<p> Net sales					   68.3 vs 71.3</p>
<p> Operating profit				  10.3 vs 27.3</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	13.5 vs 30.0</p>
<p> Depreciation					 3.2 vs 2.7</p>
<p> Net financial items			gain 11.1 vs 7.2 gain</p>
<p> Taxes						  7.0 vs 9.7</p>
<p> Net profit					  14.4 vs 24.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Turkistuottajat Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
